@step List sessions for the intended profile.
aeat config profile sessions
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Lock the caller's session.
aeat config profile lock
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Lock a selected session.
@static aeat config profile lock --session SESSION_UUID
@blocked operator-artifact SESSION_UUID must come from the actual session inventory for the intended profile.
@step Lock the profile everywhere and suspend automation.
aeat config profile lock --all
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Confirm private profile access refuses while the profile-wide lock remains active.
@result aeat --format json config profile view
@expect error.context.reason == "profile_locked"
@expect exit_code == 2
